+			<return type="Dictionary" />
+			<description>
+				Returns the current Forward+ view's borrowed sky radiance for DDGI on the rendering thread, after sky setup. An empty dictionary means no active sky. Keys are [code]texture[/code] (2D octahedral RD texture, base roughness), [code]normalization[/code] (multiply to remove baked camera exposure and luminance scaling, retaining environment energy and intensity), [code]rotation[/code] (inverse environment sky Basis), [code]border[/code] (UV padding), and [code]revision[/code] (base radiance update counter). Do not free the texture or keep it beyond this callback. No screen color or post-processing is included.
+			</description>
+		</method>
 		<method name="clear_ddgi" experimental="Project DDGI integration.">
 			<return type="void" />
 			<description>
